  note    text is added by setting the whole text, `Append`'s

capability ui/password  a text field whose text is masked
  heroes  ui.password_field
  go      ui.NewPasswordEntry
  rust    -
  python  -
  wx      wxTextCtrl (wxTE_PASSWORD)
  note    a text field in every other way; `render` draws one mark a character and never the text; macOS by `NSSecureTextField` put in the field's place, Windows pending (`ES_PASSWORD`), Linux pending (`gtk_text_set_visibility` false, or a `GtkPasswordEntry`)

